{"2329800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Away To The Stars", "steam_appid": 2329800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/bbef724a0622362aec24761ebde3a0a9.avif?t=1780033844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras_big/bbef724a0622362aec24761ebde3a0a9.webp?t=1780033844 width=1560 height=172 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b657f6b55624147eefe3e50fd774bc4c.poster.avif?t=1780033844\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b657f6b55624147eefe3e50fd774bc4c.webm?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b657f6b55624147eefe3e50fd774bc4c.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover procedurally generated planets with caves, islands, cities, events and distinct weather across galaxies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/f489aff0f143e0a9cb69c411481d2d05.avif?t=1780033844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras_big/f489aff0f143e0a9cb69c411481d2d05.webp?t=1780033844 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b97d3b42f0024cd8df8a4799aa6dadc9.poster.avif?t=1780033844\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b97d3b42f0024cd8df8a4799aa6dadc9.webm?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b97d3b42f0024cd8df8a4799aa6dadc9.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a diverse range of weapons to adapt your playstyle dodging, ranged, or melee in demanding, skill-based bullet hell planet combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or Engage in spaceship battles: steal, tow, or board ships and freighters, and command your ship from the cockpit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you fall, the story continues and may take you to a new place.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b5d20a0a396acf9969fe30c1043c621c.avif?t=1780033844\" width=1386 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.poster.avif?t=1780033844\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.webm?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover your origins by recovering lost pieces of information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hire and care for companions from different races, who may die on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help factions through procedural quests or engage in complex dialogue choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/2591c17c1032948f9e4c894c373d1045.poster.avif?t=1780033844\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/2591c17c1032948f9e4c894c373d1045.webm?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/2591c17c1032948f9e4c894c373d1045.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/cb34de2c79fc7c24f8cbdf7af87b1a27.avif?t=1780033844\" width=1452 height=201 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/29fc8782ede8be4a59f6dc1aa06a83f8.poster.avif?t=1780033844\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/29fc8782ede8be4a59f6dc1aa06a83f8.webm?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/29fc8782ede8be4a59f6dc1aa06a83f8.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and craft items essential for survival and adapting to the planets you visit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell houses, items, and ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Improve a wide range of skills through use to unlock perks that help you survive longer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game in constant development since 2016 and still going strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/bbef724a0622362aec24761ebde3a0a9.avif?t=1780033844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras_big/bbef724a0622362aec24761ebde3a0a9.webp?t=1780033844 width=1560 height=172 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b657f6b55624147eefe3e50fd774bc4c.poster.avif?t=1780033844\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b657f6b55624147eefe3e50fd774bc4c.webm?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/b657f6b55624147eefe3e50fd774bc4c.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover procedurally generated planets with caves, islands, cities, events and distinct weather across galaxies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/f489aff0f143e0a9cb69c411481d2d05.avif?t=1780033844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras_big/f489aff0f143e0a9cb69c411481d2d05.webp?t=1780033844 width=1560 height=111 />