xtras/5fd7ceb9b7ad3ab2aeff9e79943acdf2.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover your origins by recovering lost pieces of information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hire and care for companions from different races, who may die on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help factions through procedural quests or engage in complex dialogue choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/2591c17c1032948f9e4c894c373d1045.poster.avif?t=1780033844\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/2591c17c1032948f9e4c894c373d1045.webm?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/2591c17c1032948f9e4c894c373d1045.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/cb34de2c79fc7c24f8cbdf7af87b1a27.avif?t=1780033844\" width=1452 height=201 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/29fc8782ede8be4a59f6dc1aa06a83f8.poster.avif?t=1780033844\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/29fc8782ede8be4a59f6dc1aa06a83f8.webm?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/extras/29fc8782ede8be4a59f6dc1aa06a83f8.mp4?t=1780033844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and craft items essential for survival and adapting to the planets you visit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell houses, items, and ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Improve a wide range of skills through use to unlock perks that help you survive longer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game in constant development since 2016 and still going strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore over 1 million planets in an endless universe. Fight in brutal ground combat, from your ship, or aboard your freighter. Hack, loot, steal, upgrade, craft, build, and deceive your way to power. Uncover your past and help humanity find a new home. If No Man’s Sky and Starbound had a child.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "reviews": "“Love what you're doing with this game! Been having a blast exploring and seeing the content there is to offer.”<br>Veetus<br><br>“They just made Starfield here!”<br>Videogameiacs<br><br>“Btw, I love the vibe you got going here. The music really ties it together”<br>Retronator<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/1a959523852531ee87e6b853d199977d1c210c81/header.jpg?t=1780033844", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/4f02e133e36e796d28dfc684b7da610fc455599f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780033844", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329800/4f02e133e36e796d28dfc684b7da610fc455599f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780033844", "website": "https://trello.com/b/GqTRk82D/away-to-the-stars-roadmap", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memo